          "urpx:name": "Eligibility for Schedule TOU-D Option PRIME — residential customer",
          "urpx:description": "Available to Customers eligible for service under Schedule D, D-CARE or D-FERA (Sheet 1): residential customers individually metered by SCE. Not available to Customers receiving service under Schedules DM, DMS-1, DMS-2 or DMS-3. The twelve-month minimum stay of Special Condition 5 applies to elective rate changes.",
